{
  "id": "nexusAgentOrchestrator",
  "name": "NOMIKOS SYNERGATHS · Agent Orchestrator",
  "description": "The real evidence-first document intelligence orchestration. The application triggers the case webhook, n8n invokes every stage through authenticated backend endpoints, and specialist agents remain visible as secure on-demand branches.",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# NOMIKOS SYNERGATHS · AGENT ORCHESTRATOR\n### Evidence-first automation · visible, traceable, fail-closed\n\nEvery functional node below calls a real FastAPI endpoint. The application forwards its server-side integration header through n8n; the backend validates it before any agent runs. Complete case evidence remains in the backend.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 3430,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "0c1571ee-cde3-4d76-9bb2-0e7d1f9ad001",
      "name": "NOMIKOS SYNERGATHS · Agent Orchestrator",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -590
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 01 · SECURE APPLICATION INTAKE\nA pre-indexed PDF enters from the application with an integration header. n8n forwards that header only to the backend, where it is validated before the case starts.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 870,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "0c1571ee-cde3-4d76-9bb2-0e7d1f9ad002",
      "name": "01 · Secure application intake",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -370
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02 · CASE INTELLIGENCE\nThe stages are deliberately sequential: each agent reads the persisted, evidence-scoped case state created by the previous stage. Parallelising these agents would be incorrect.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 1760,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0c1571ee-cde3-4d76-9bb2-0e7d1f9ad003",
      "name": "02 · Case intelligence",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1130,
        -370
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 03 · FAIL-CLOSED RELEASE GATE\nThe Hallucination Auditor is mandatory. A failed or unavailable audit never becomes an automatic action: the final pack is explicitly marked for human review.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 820,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "0c1571ee-cde3-4d76-9bb2-0e7d1f9ad004",
      "name": "03 · Fail-closed release gate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2920,
        -370
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 04 · SECURED ON-DEMAND INTELLIGENCE\nThese are genuine, independent agent routes — not decorative branches. Each requires an integration header, calls its respective backend agent, and the backend validates the key before returning real citations / trace in JSON.\n\nUse them only when the request needs that capability; the core case pipeline never runs unnecessary agents just to make a diagram look busy.",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 3430,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "0c1571ee-cde3-4d76-9bb2-0e7d1f9ad005",
      "name": "04 · Secured on-demand intelligence",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        350
      ]
    },
